29. FINAL STATEMENT
This task demonstrated the complete workflow for location-based restaurant analysis, including geographical data validation, city and locality aggregation, rating and pricing analysis, cuisine analysis, service analysis, interactive geographical visualization, identification of geographical patterns, and interpretation of results.